            "6. To demonstrate that SLED is effective on long text understanding tasks and it can also be used on any pretrained encoder-decoder models.",
            "7. To use SLED to analyze how local are individual pieces of relevant information.",
            "8. To analyze whether indeed the entire document is required for different tasks by varying the maximum input length.",
