            "Tab.~\\ref{tab:main_results} reports results over \\SCROLLS{} development and test sets.\n",
            "Taking short-range pretrained LMs like BART and T5 and casting them into \\sled{}'s framework allows them to process long documents effectively, improving the average \\SCROLLS{} score by 4.8-7 points.\n",
